/-!
# Marked local geometry for the symmetric wreath configuration

Every source configuration admits actual wreath coordinates aligned with
its original Sylow subgroup. The two S₄ factors, their intersections with T,
the swap, and the elements t and z are retained in G. Four explicit
subgroups of T are proved elementary abelian of order sixteen.

The exhaustive maximum-order family, the two-core identification, ambient
normalizers and fusion, involution classes, and extraspecial quotient are
further obligations in the assembly of Aschbacher–Smith 13.9.2–4 and 13.9.6.
Source: combined manuscript of 1 March 2004, printed pp.969–971 (PDF pp.986–988).
-/
